{"symbol":"TELGE","yahoo":"TELGE.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Telge Projects Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Engineering & Construction","website":"https://www.telgeprojects.com","about":"Telge Projects Limited engages in the provision of engineering design services in India. The company offers building information modeling (BIM) services for digital representation of a building project, including structural steel, miscellaneous steel, cold form structures, precast concrete, prestressed concrete, and cast in place concrete; structural engineering design services from developing structural drawings to creating detailed 3D models for industrial, residential, and commercial buildings; material takeoff (MTO) which includes all materials needed for a construction project, including their quantities and specifications; 2D drafting, a process of creating two-dimensional technical drawings using software; and architectural drafting services that translate architectural designs into technical drawings used for construction. Its design solutions includes industrial towers, material conveyers, metro stations, mixed-use developments, office buildings, parking garages, PEB sheds structure, piper conveyor systems, PPVC (prefabricated prefinished volumetric construction) modules construction, residential complex, retaining walls, school buildings, sports stadium units, tunnel units, warehouse and storages, water tanks, railway foot over bridge, and extensions buildings. The company also provides management consultancy services. It operates in Australia, Canada, Ireland, Latvia, Malaysia, New Zealand, Poland, Sweden, the United Kingdom, and the United States. Telge Projects Limited was incorporated in 2018 and is headquartered in Pune, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T08:39:37+00:00","quote":{"price":270.0,"prevClose":276.0,"marketCap":264.33,"high52":283.95,"low52":77.05,"pe":34.79,"bookValue":45.26,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":0.979,"insiders":